    [23065]="Item Level 92\nBinds when picked up\nUniqueFinger\n+16 Stamina\n+16 Intellect\nRestores +6 mana per 5 sec.Classes: Shaman\n\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Increases healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 36.\n\nThe Earthshatterer (0/9)Earthshatter Boots\nEarthshatter Girdle\nEarthshatter Handguards\nEarthshatter Headpiece\nEarthshatter Legguards\nEarthshatter Spaulders\nEarthshatter Tunic\nEarthshatter Wristguards\nRing of the Earthshatterer\n\n(2) Set : Reduces the mana cost of your totem spells by 12%.\n(4) Set : Increases the mana gained from your Mana Spring totems by 25%.\n(6) Set : Your Healing Wave and Lesser Healing Wave spells have a chance to imbue your target with Totemic Power. (Proc chance: 10%)\n(8) Set : Your Lightning Shield spell also grants you 15 mana per 5 sec. while active.\nSell Price: 6 2 56",
